{"id": "7-891", "question": "A recyclable material can be", "step_idx": 3, "options": ["A): transformed", "B): traded", "C): thrown away", "D): used more times"], "correct": "D", "initial_cot": "1. Recyclable materials are those that can be processed and used again.\n2. The goal of recycling is to reduce waste and conserve resources.\n3. Transforming a recyclable material means changing its form or composition to make it usable again.\n4. Trading a recyclable material implies exchanging it for something else, which doesn't necessarily involve recycling.\n5. Throwing away a recyclable material would be counterproductive to the purpose of recycling.\n6. Using a recyclable material more times means extending its lifespan and reducing the need for new resources.", "initial_cot_probs": [4.892239303444512e-06, 1.9993464661638427e-08, 1.9993464661638427e-08, 4.317385901231319e-06], "initial_probs": [0.00015770038589835167, 1.0081447726406623e-05, 1.7518930235382868e-06, 3.518771336530335e-05], "prediction": 0, "cot_prediction": 0, "rt_lambda": 1.0, "cot_step": "The goal of recycling is to reduce waste and conserve resources.", "segmented_cot": ["1.", "Recyclable materials are those that can be processed and used again.", "2.", "The goal of recycling is to reduce waste and conserve resources.", "3.", "Transforming a recyclable material means changing its form or composition to make it usable again.", "4.", "Trading a recyclable material implies exchanging it for something else, which doesn't necessarily involve recycling.", "5.", "Throwing away a recyclable material would be counterproductive to the purpose of recycling.", "6.", "Using a recyclable material more times means extending its lifespan and reducing the need for new resources."], "unlearning_results": {"0": {"completion": "A).\n\nRecyclable materials are", "probs": [0.00015770038589835167, 1.0081447726406623e-05, 1.7518930235382868e-06, 3.518771336530335e-05], "prediction": 0, "target_cot_step": "The goal of recyc